activitytrack-web (0.9.5-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Offline maps for the phones: the new Mappe page (administrators) chooses
    the areas and the zoom level, the server prepares them from the Protomaps
    basemap (HTTP range requests, small PMTiles files of a few MB) and the
    phones receive them with the sync (sync/head carries mapsRev, GET maps,
    GET maps/<id>). Off until an administrator turns it on; docs/OFFLINE-MAPS.md.
  * English translation of the whole web interface and a language choice in
    Preferences (otherwise the browser's language); <html lang> follows the
    language. django.mo is committed, so the package needs no msgfmt.
  * Policy catalog of the app 0.9.5 (trackMap, trackExport, trackMapEnabled,
    workSampleMin, travelSampleSec, offlineMapsEnabled; known from 0.9.5).
  * The tests on the installed files compare the messages of django.mo, not
    its header, which the package build normalises.

